{"id":"7d28f785db64c74b","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-microlocal.md","title":"Microlocal Analysis","display":"df-microlocal — Microlocal Analysis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-microlocal","aliases":["58-df-microlocal"],"display":"df-microlocal — Microlocal Analysis","depends_on":["[[58-df-wave-front-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-microlocal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-microlocal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-microlocal — Microlocal Analysis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e23ce64dcd9dfdbf\" href=\"?note=e23ce64dcd9dfdbf\" title=\"58-df-wave-front-set\">58-df-wave-front-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_0,\\xi_0)\\in\\Omega\\times(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\})\">\\((x_0,\\xi_0)\\in\\Omega\\times(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e23ce64dcd9dfdbf\" href=\"?note=e23ce64dcd9dfdbf\" title=\"58-df-wave-front-set\">58-df-wave-front-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MicroSmooth}_S(u;x_0,\\xi_0,\\Omega,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{MicroSmooth}_S(u;x_0,\\xi_0,\\Omega,n)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}microlocal} \\vdash \\operatorname{MicroSmooth}_S(u;x_0,\\xi_0,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists W\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\\land(x_0,\\xi_0)\\notin W\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}microlocal} \\vdash \\operatorname{MicroSmooth}_S(u;x_0,\\xi_0,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists W\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\\land(x_0,\\xi_0)\\notin W\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Wave front set detects singularities and their directions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(u) = \\emptyset \\iff u \\in C^\\infty(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(u) = \\emptyset \\iff u \\in C^\\infty(\\Omega)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Elliptic operators propagate wave front: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(Pu) = \\mathrm{WF}(u)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(Pu) = \\mathrm{WF}(u)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Applications: hypoellipticity, propagation of singularities.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-wave-front-set","status":"resolved","id":"e23ce64dcd9dfdbf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-wave-front-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wave-front-set","status":"resolved","id":"e23ce64dcd9dfdbf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)$ (see [[58-df-wave-front-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal D'(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"(x_0,\\xi_0)\\in\\Omega\\times(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MicroSmooth}_S(u;x_0,\\xi_0,\\Omega,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}microlocal} \\vdash \\operatorname{MicroSmooth}_S(u;x_0,\\xi_0,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists W\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\\land(x_0,\\xi_0)\\notin W\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(u) = \\emptyset \\iff u \\in C^\\infty(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(Pu) = \\mathrm{WF}(u)","display":false}],"bytes":1059,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-844","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-microlocal.md|58-df-microlocal]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["e23ce64dcd9dfdbf"]}